            <div xml:id="m-37076836-110f-4f25-a450-6f89507428d4">
              <lg xml:id="m-fc83e9ca-855f-4c65-ada3-392aef026943">
                <l xml:id="m-215388e8-0488-4a16-a4bb-82bd3ed4f875" facs="#m-4f478636-2b82-43f1-9119-519d308846a3" label="text-like">1092 Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-d78d3091-978f-40b7-b4d8-7048c3a4359b" facs="#m-0ce13163-d4a8-4485-871e-3eea3dbf4736" label="ambiguous">Friday.</l><l xml:id="m-f7fd027c-68c5-4ddf-8fa8-2e5fdd99f818" facs="#m-867df74e-d823-420d-a09e-969c0770e2c2" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-c03ba72f-ec65-450a-b599-8d8c8ac68c68" facs="#m-61d91b96-8fad-441a-995c-542f258f359d" label="ambiguous">Ant. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-31bf4a01-a413-432d-b33e-1a5a85471f4d" facs="#m-2e73613c-cc68-48b4-b1de-7f57ec1da4b3" label="ambiguous">H</l><l xml:id="m-f4759fb8-8482-4843-af2f-70ca04fd0e80" facs="#m-c0cc9974-5439-46a5-9dca-2d312a02d3de" label="lyrics-like">-quam“quam égo dédero, qui bibe-rit ex é¬a,</l><l xml:id="m-f8d59f06-057a-41a7-bd22-f56cd0bc6325" facs="#m-8f40d131-8d1b-459d-950c-892d321b999b" label="lyrics-like">non sí-ti-et unquam.</l><l xml:id="m-b98d3679-5f98-4a48-939c-d1769ada75de" facs="#m-e7e5563e-b06f-4587-9163-e5f30d16a423" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-cc08075b-1307-4778-b50e-794b6b3d6bc0" facs="#m-c83bb6c5-d1c3-40a0-b798-d8d5c47b8cf4" label="lyrics-like">IEjúnia nostra, quaésumus Dó-] tinémus in córpore; * ita a vitiis</l><l xml:id="m-bcff9235-de3d-4a0e-b207-0c65853a456d" facs="#m-309beb1b-0833-477a-b34d-6aa279382409" label="lyrics-like">C mine, benigno favóre prosé- jejunémus in mente. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-5d81ef4f-eb2b-42ef-9b1b-0c3b05807764" facs="#m-9c441904-c97f-4252-b677-938f055e3ac6" label="lyrics-like">quere: fut sicut ab aliméntis abs¬</l><l xml:id="m-79683a76-6c23-42b3-8fbf-013d5a384d42" facs="#m-c11efdb8-e23b-4088-aadc-6f59d660227e" label="text-like">At vesp.</l><l xml:id="m-52302d4e-3d0c-4882-bcd2-724c23597785" facs="#m-9c0f2c40-b77d-471b-b756-aeb1e9b89ae3" label="ambiguous">Ant. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-12d34d9d-960c-4f94-a4f3-96a3e71c3c33" facs="#m-0ad0ccdf-e0fe-4404-ba3a-d92fd390d1ec" label="ambiguous">D</l><l xml:id="m-22fc0c70-52e4-4786-927a-cb2a466aee73" facs="#m-adfd3354-7954-4a43-a001-7eec04837a20" label="lyrics-like">Omine, * ut víde-o, prophé-ta es tu : pá̂tres</l><l xml:id="m-65a1c214-311d-4709-96f7-b0b42ebc5348" facs="#m-c00cb1d2-5b42-4c0f-9dc5-aeef8ced15b9" label="lyrics-like">nóstri in mónte hoc ad-oravé-runt.</l><l xml:id="m-37a05d4c-550a-4a98-adba-c7700f7ff517" facs="#m-f6d4dc32-986c-4a06-8da6-e832c4f7ea5a" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-ca17a3f5-8e22-4334-9ca6-26c6b5a1a840" facs="#m-a3df3b7c-2a40-41a9-b938-60f882a4875f" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens) adversántia te adjuvánte vincámus.</l><l xml:id="m-e4301600-d8c3-4ce8-89a5-41e112691ffa" facs="#m-ecedcdf4-5383-415c-ba6e-0a49cee90173" label="ambiguous">E Deus: f ut qui in tua prote¬</l><l xml:id="m-8948b777-a01c-45f5-8935-63454fb9a0df" facs="#m-3668529a-5b43-4e85-95b7-a524edb6f00d" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-1c8328db-aabd-4760-bfdb-d488c3b727d3" facs="#m-3a37fcde-85a3-46e8-9de8-8d6129d10f44" label="lyrics-like">ctióne confidimus, * cuncta nobis</l><l xml:id="m-c675e3ac-11dc-4d2a-a689-c1f6434e13ad" facs="#m-7f1e6ba6-d955-4757-a124-0830c94b2431" label="ambiguous">Saturday.</l><l xml:id="m-20604dc3-d77f-4511-8536-cf277f12cbfe" facs="#m-34c5cbab-fef4-422f-9951-075637ac1ae4" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-3751a782-7911-4dbf-9968-099533cfbd7e" facs="#m-92d94f9a-867a-4854-84ee-1ffc8eb15495" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-acf51394-928b-4d0c-a49c-5e18c24c7e95" facs="#m-9d70c846-70e4-4040-b10d-bbc36a1831d3" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-9d6af6cb-5b72-4865-ab7d-bb59dbaf398c" facs="#m-03919565-f010-4246-bda0-2cdd661e470d" label="lyrics-like">Nclinávit se Jé-sus, *scribébat in térra:</l><l xml:id="m-2a9ddf4d-09f7-4a6b-90b6-7ec72ea1c979" facs="#m-b1c2f4f6-2033-415b-b2f9-a6c5c3228b20" label="lyrics-like">Si quis sine peccá-to est, míttat in é-am lápidem.</l><l xml:id="m-1a3a1597-e094-4f8d-a016-0ce794b6fd57" facs="#m-160b330e-3c76-4739-aeb2-4ed665e5e8e6" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-de4f3d9d-e1a6-488b-8366-33727a41f8b8" facs="#m-10c8ddac-2724-43b5-b660-5503bdafe0ab" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnipotens sectándo justitiam a culpa jejúnent.</l><l xml:id="m-f817954e-e2ea-4d5f-b6c8-0c9512671cbd" facs="#m-945e2e4b-474c-4b5b-9092-fa084739be37" label="lyrics-like">E Deus: f ut qui se, affligéndo</l><l xml:id="m-235e4a9c-a39d-4194-a4c0-0111f9983521" facs="#m-c24c0574-3665-414e-b0eb-2269ddbcc04c" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-127f3347-dd6d-4cbf-954c-0adb03a416da" facs="#m-c3695d4a-d33e-42ac-9660-7f5964da8034" label="lyrics-like">carnem, ab aliméntis ábstinent;</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
